sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Interviewer
    participant C as Candidate
    I->>C: design a system under a reliability constraint
    C->>I: who uses it, at what rate, and what may not break?
    C->>C: write the SLIs and SLO targets down first
    C->>C: estimate QPS, storage, and bandwidth
    C->>I: sketch the data flow before the boxes
    I->>C: now it is 10x the traffic
    C->>C: where does it break first — CPU, storage, or a lock?
    C->>C: partition, cache, or shed — pick and justify
    I->>C: a region just went away
    C->>C: blast radius, failover path, and what data is lost
    Note over C: every answer ends with what you would measure and what would page you
